4-lactone). Some preclinical studies have demonstrated saccharolactone to have anticancerogenic and detoxification properties, although more clinical research is needed to confirm health impacts in humans.", "titolo": "Saccharic acid", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saccharic_acid"}, "wikipedia_titoli": {"en": "Saccharic acid"}}